 guards to protect your store from shoplifters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670630/extras/Protect.gif?t=1750407211\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Supermarket Simulator&quot;, every decision matters. Will you rise to the occasion, transforming a modest establishment into a retail powerhouse, all while balancing customer satisfaction, and finances?</p>","developers":["Nokta Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670630/36ce8ddf772b7f205e0eeaf741262798097c622e/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1750407211","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158250,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158250/movie480.mp4?t=1750354455","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158250/movie_max.mp4?t=1750354455"},"name":"Full Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158250/986d3bd79ee725a6f7109ef7f9bde1dfef90983a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750354455","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158250/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750354455","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co